OL,3,CNo HAP properties available to rent
OL,4,Coutside Dublin or Kildare in June `
OL,5,Ccharity
OL,7,FNo properties were available to rent
OL,8,Fwithin a welfare scheme in areas
OL,9,Foutside Dublin or Kildare in June,
OL,10,Faccording to a housing charity's
OL,11,Fanalysis.
OL,13,FThe Simon Communities of Ireland also
OL,14,Ffound that just 20 properties were
OL,15,Favailable to rent under Housing
OL,16,FAssistance Payment scheme limits in 16
OL,17,Fareas they surveyed in June.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
