OL,3,CNo HAP properties available to rent
OL,4,Coutside Dublin or Kildare in June `
OL,5,Ccharity
OL,7,FThe Housing Assistance Payment (HAP)
OL,8,Fscheme is a social housing payment
OL,9,Fmade to landlords by local
OL,10,Fauthorities, where tenants pay a
OL,11,Fcontribution to their local authority.
OL,13,FTo avail of HAP, the landlord's rent
OL,14,Fmust be within the limits for the
OL,15,Fhousehold type and local authority
OL,16,Farea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785975492
OL,3,CNo HAP properties available to rent
OL,4,Coutside Dublin or Kildare in June `
OL,5,Ccharity
OL,7,FThe quarterly Locked Out of the Market
OL,8,Freport by Simon Communities of
OL,9,FIreland's (SCI) indicates that just 20
OL,10,Fproperties were available to rent
OL,11,Fwithin any of the HAP limits across
OL,12,Fthree dates in June.
OL,14,FThe report found 1,303 properties were
OL,15,Favailable to rent at any price within
OL,16,Fthe 16 areas surveyed over the three
OL,17,Fdates surveyed in June.
OL,19,FThis is an increase of 22% since March
OL,20,Fthis year and of 33% since March 2025.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785975492
OL,3,CNo HAP properties available to rent
OL,4,Coutside Dublin or Kildare in June `
OL,5,Ccharity
OL,7,FThis is the second such report since a
OL,8,Fseries of rent reforms came into force
OL,9,Fin March, where a cap on rents in some
OL,10,Fareas was replaced with a nationwide
OL,11,Fcap that allows landlords to raise
OL,12,Frents beyond the limit, of a maximum
OL,13,Fof 2%, to match the market rate when
OL,14,Fnewly introduced six-year tenancies
OL,15,Fend.
OL,17,FThree of the 16 areas examined in the
OL,18,FSimon Community report saw a reduction
OL,19,Fin the number of HAP properties
OL,20,Favailable since their last report in
OL,21,FMarch.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785975492
OL,3,CNo HAP properties available to rent
OL,4,Coutside Dublin or Kildare in June `
OL,5,Ccharity
OL,7,FThese include Cork City Centre,
OL,8,FDundalk, and Sligo Town, which all saw
OL,9,Fa reduction of one property each.
OL,11,FThe supply of properties within HAP
OL,12,Flimits continue to mainly be located
OL,13,Fin the Dublin area.
OL,15,FOf 20 available HAP properties, 17
OL,16,Fwere in three Dublin study areas, and
OL,17,Fonly one of the 13 study areas outside
OL,18,Fof Dublin had properties available to
OL,19,Frent within HAP limits ` Kildare,
OL,20,Fwhich had three properties.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
