OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785975492
OL,3,CNo HAP properties available to rent
OL,4,Coutside Dublin or Kildare in June `
OL,5,Ccharity
OL,7,FExecutive director at the Simon
OL,8,FCommunities of Ireland Ber Grogan
OL,9,Fsaid: "The Simon Communities of
OL,10,FIreland has published the Locked Out
OL,11,Fof the Market Report for over 10
OL,12,Fyears, and our message has remained
OL,13,Fthe same ` the HAP system needs reform.
OL,15,F"It is almost one year since the
OL,16,Fminister confirmed that a review of
OL,17,FHAP was under way, yet we are still no
OL,18,Fclearer on its findings or
OL,19,Frecommendations.
OL,26,@qD@GOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785975492
OL,3,CNo HAP properties available to rent
OL,4,Coutside Dublin or Kildare in June `
OL,5,Ccharity
OL,7,F"Will Budget 2027 finally deliver the
OL,8,Flong-awaited increase to HAP limits?
OL,10,F"The quarter one 2026 Homeless
OL,11,FProgress Report showed that HAP was
OL,12,Fused less than in the same period last
OL,13,Fyear, either as a homeless prevention
OL,14,Fmeasure or as an exit from
OL,15,Fhomelessness.
OL,17,F"HAP is not working. People are still
OL,18,Flocked out of the market. We see and
OL,19,Fhear this on the ground every single
OL,20,Fday, across the country. People are
OL,21,Fbeing discriminated against.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
