CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785975492
OL,3,CNo HAP properties available to rent
OL,4,Coutside Dublin or Kildare in June `
OL,5,Ccharity
OL,7,F"There is one short-term solution that
OL,8,Fwould make an immediate difference `
OL,9,Fincrease the HAP limits."
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@YO]
